  "content": {
    "id": "p30-stem-65-68",
    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "Solve the following for $0^\\circ\\leq\\theta\\leq360^\\circ$.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p30-q65",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\sin\\theta=\\sin10^\\circ$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\theta=10^\\circ,170^\\circ$.",
          "worked": "The related angle is $10^\\circ$. Sine is positive in quadrants 1 and 2.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\theta&=10^\\circ,\\ 180^\\circ-10^\\circ\\\\\\theta&=10^\\circ,\\ 170^\\circ\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
      },
      {
        "id": "p30-q66",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\cos\\theta=\\cos135^\\circ$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\theta=135^\\circ,225^\\circ$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\alpha&=180^\\circ-135^\\circ\\\\\\alpha&=45^\\circ\\end{align*}$$\n\nCosine is negative in quadrants 2 and 3.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\theta&=180^\\circ-45^\\circ,\\ 180^\\circ+45^\\circ\\\\\\theta&=135^\\circ,\\ 225^\\circ\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 52
      },
      {
        "id": "p30-q67",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\tan\\theta=\\tan265^\\circ$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\theta=85^\\circ,265^\\circ$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\alpha&=265^\\circ-180^\\circ\\\\\\alpha&=85^\\circ\\end{align*}$$\n\nTangent is positive in quadrants 1 and 3; its solutions are $180^\\circ$ apart.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\theta&=85^\\circ,\\ 85^\\circ+180^\\circ\\\\\\theta&=85^\\circ,\\ 265^\\circ\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 52
      },
      {
        "id": "p30-q68",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$\\sin\\theta=\\sin290^\\circ$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\theta=250^\\circ,290^\\circ$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\alpha&=360^\\circ-290^\\circ\\\\\\alpha&=70^\\circ\\end{align*}$$\n\nSine is negative in quadrants 3 and 4.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\theta&=180^\\circ+70^\\circ,\\ 360^\\circ-70^\\circ\\\\\\theta&=250^\\circ,\\ 290^\\circ\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 52
      }
    ]
